AArch64 stop-slot-relaxed
"stop-slot-release with the state (b) stored without release ordering (P0): the leader can see the state and the registers from before they were written"
{
0:X1=a; 0:X3=b;
1:X1=a; 1:X3=b;
}
 P0           | P1           ;
 MOV W0,#42   | LDAR W0,[X3] ;
 STR W0,[X1]  | LDR W2,[X1]  ;
 MOV W2,#3    |              ;
 STR W2,[X3]  |              ;
exists (1:X0=3 /\ 1:X2=0)
